【来源1】{"claim": "James wants the dog walking and pet care app to let users add their pup's preferences and needs, making it unique for each owner and pup.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "James", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-03-17T15:47:00+00:00", "text": "James: [Image: a photo of a notepad with a handwritten note on it] Thanks, John! The personal touch really sets it apart. Users can add their pup's preferences/needs - just like they were customizing it for them. Making it unique for each owner and pup.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源2】{"claim": "James has not worked with any other programming languages but hopes to in the future.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "James", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-03-17T15:47:00+00:00", "text": "James: I haven’t worked with any other programming languages, but I hope to work in the future.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源3】{"claim": "James is getting into different types of games, like RPGs and strategy games.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "James", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-03-27T00:40:00+00:00", "text": "James: I'm getting into different types of games now, like RPGs and strategy games. It's really exciting!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源4】{"claim": "James has tried VR and finds it feels very real.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "James", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-03-17T15:47:00+00:00", "text": "James: I tried it - it's crazy how real it feels! Have you given it a shot?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源5】{"claim": "James offered to help John find a pet.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "James", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-03-20T21:26:00+00:00", "text": "James: A pet would truly be great for you! They bring so much love and companionship. If you're interested, I can help find the perfect one for you - you'd make a great pet parent!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源6】{"claim": "John wants to have a pet but does not have one yet.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-03-20T21:26:00+00:00", "text": "John: Aww, they're adorable! Pets are the best - they must make life so much better. I want one so bad, but I'm not there yet. Someday!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
